															<img decoding="async" width="600" height="300" src="https://huntersthospitality.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Hunter-St.-Logo-White-600-×-300-px.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-15741" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://huntersthospitality.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Hunter-St.-Logo-White-600-×-300-px.png 600w, https://huntersthospitality.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Hunter-St.-Logo-White-600-×-300-px-300x150.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" />															</div>
