				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;">A </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;">Melbourne </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;">powerhouse</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;"> that delivers a </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;">unique </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;">Italian </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;">dining </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;">experience every step of the way, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;">from stylish glamo</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;">u</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;">r</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;"> to exquisite dishes and </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;">an emphasis on </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;">superb </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW193660477 BCX4" style="font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 21px;">regional wines.</span></p>						</div>
				</div>
